ecision and leave  King's Landing Cersei will eventually  lose to Daenerys and I don't see Cersei  giving up she's going to die trying  and I don't see Jaime going out like  that he's either gonna kill Cersei  before she goes mad again or he's going  to abandon her either way Jaime will  eventually leave King's Landing which he  will then side with Tyrion or Brienne  Tyrion and bran  both have a stark connection which could  also put Jaime in position to do the  right thing by the Starks but these are  all just my opinions and I would  completely understand if you disagree  with me so comment below and tell me  what you think Jaime's end games going  to be do you agree with me or do you see  it playing out another way let me know  your thoughts as always thank you all so  much for stopping by to watch the video  and a special thanks to my supporters on  patreon I love all y'all and I'll see  you down below bye
 

